OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,FBritish sprinter Amy Hunt is among the
OL,7,Ffemale athletes who have criticised
OL,8,FSydney Sweeney's nude ad campaign for
OL,9,Fa sports betting company.
OL,11,FThe Euphoria actress, 29, posed naked
OL,12,Fwith footballs, a tennis racket, a
OL,13,Fbaseball and hockey stick in the ad
OL,14,Fcampaign for Novig.
OL,16,FThe ad has received pushback from
OL,17,Fseveral female athletes, who felt it
OL,18,Fwas "sexualising women's sport".
OL,26,@zD@EOUzD@_O]
