OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1789943307
OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,FHunt was among those who expressed
OL,7,Fopposition to the ad when she finished
OL,8,Ffourth in the 200m final at the
OL,9,FUltimate Championship in Budapest on
OL,10,FSunday.
OL,12,FIn a post-race interview with BBC
OL,13,FSport, she said: "Sydney Sweeney, this
OL,14,Fis what women in sport look like."
OL,26,@uD@ROUvD@bO]
