OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,FHunt finished the race in a season
OL,7,Fbest time of 22.10 seconds and,
OL,8,Freferencing first place finisher
OL,9,FMelissa Jefferson-Wooden's time of
OL,10,F21.47 seconds, added: "21.4. Muscles.
OL,11,FHard work, blood, sweat, tears. This
OL,12,Fis a beautiful evening."
OL,14,FBritish cycling gold medalist Sophie
OL,15,FCapewell posted on Instagram showing
OL,16,Fher workout routine in the gym and on
OL,17,Fthe track.
OL,26,@rD@WOUtD@XO]
