OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1789943307
OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,FShe captioned it with: "I'm sure
OL,7,Fyou've seen Sydney Sweeney's ad, but
OL,8,Fimagine a world where women are seen,
OL,9,Ffor what they can do not just what
OL,10,Fthey look like.
OL,12,F"It is cool to be an athlete, it is
OL,13,Fgood to be strong. Imagine a world
OL,14,Fwhere sexualised representation isn't
OL,15,Fthe most popular way of seeing women
OL,16,Fin sport."
OL,18,FBritish rugby union player Ellie
OL,19,FBoatman also critcised the ad on
OL,20,FInstagram.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/10
