OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F306A1789943307
OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,FShe said: "Sorry what the actual heck
OL,7,Fis going on with that sports Ad, but
OL,8,Fhey Sydney this is what women's sport
OL,9,Factually looks like.
OL,11,F"We train and work hard to achieve
OL,12,Fwhat we have and we seriously don't
OL,13,Fwant sexualisation in sport to be the
OL,14,Fonly way women are recognised.
OL,16,F"Many of us are super feminine, love
OL,17,Fto dress up and look good but we also
OL,18,Fwant to be taken seriously as athletes
OL,19,Ftoo!!
OL,21,FThat Ad is really not it."
