OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,FOther athletes to criticise the ad
OL,7,Finclude Australian Olympic swimmer
OL,8,FAriarne Titmus, Australian water polo
OL,9,Fplayer Tilly Kearns and Australian
OL,10,Fboxer Skye Nicolson.
OL,12,FAmerican gymnast Gracie Kramer shared
OL,13,Fa video of herself performing a
OL,14,Froutine and wrote:" Idk what Sydney
OL,15,FSweeney was doing, but this is what a
OL,16,Fwoman in sports looks like."
