OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,FFollowing the backlash, Sweeney shared
OL,7,Fseveral photos of athletes posing nude
OL,8,Fon her Instagram Stories, including
OL,9,FSerena Williams, Ronda Rousey, Megan
OL,10,FRapinoe, Caroline Wozniacki and Rob
OL,11,FGronkowski.
OL,13,FSweeney previously came under fire
OL,14,Fafter the launch of a "Great Jeans"
OL,15,Fadvert that sparked a debate over race
OL,16,Fbecause of the use of "jeans" as a
OL,17,Fplay on "genes".
