OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV Wales, sent direct
OL,9,Fto your inbox every Saturday morning.
OL,11,FSome critics saw the wordplay as a nod
OL,12,Fto eugenics, the discredited theory
OL,13,Fthat humans could be improved through
OL,14,Fselective breeding, but American Eagle
OL,15,Fhas said the advert refers only to the
OL,16,Fcompany's denim jeans.
OL,18,FSweeney told US publication People: "I
OL,19,Fwas honestly surprised by the reaction.
OL,26,@zD@eOU
