OL,3,CFemale athletes hit out at Sydney
OL,4,CSweeney's nude sports betting advert
OL,6,F"I did it because I love the jeans and
OL,7,Flove the brand.
OL,9,F"I don't support the views some people
OL,10,Fchose to connect to the campaign. Many
OL,11,Fhave assigned motives and labels to me
OL,12,Fthat just aren't true.
OL,14,F"Anyone who knows me knows that I'm
OL,15,Falways trying to bring people
OL,16,Ftogether. I'm against hate and
OL,17,Fdivisiveness."
